<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $0.50-0.75 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $0.50-0.75 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 some $0.75 Higher. Demand was moderate to good on a moderate movement. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  51.00-52.75 Few 53.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  45.50-51.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  40.50-45.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.00-43.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 46.00-51.00 Few 52.00</p>
</text>
